Alignment data = fromNexus("src/test/java/resources/primate-mtDNA.nex")
Taxa taxa = taxa(data)
Tree tree ~ Yule(birthRate=1.0, taxa=taxa)
QMatrix qMatrix = jc69()

Alignment alignment ~ PhyloCTMC(tree=tree, qMatrix=qMatrix) observed as data

